    40	(defn- walk-path
    41	  "Descend a registry's :modules map along path, a sequence of symbols.
    42	
    43	   Namespace segments step through plain maps until the path reaches a
    44	   module entry (a map carrying :manifest); the remaining segments read
    45	   that entry's task-local lowered `:bindings` when it holds them -- a
    46	   linked module (yin.vm.linker.md section 8.3) -- and its `:slice`
    47	   otherwise, which for a host module is the host values themselves, so
    48	   a binding name resolves to its export."
