  1355	  "Answer the halted VM's value on the output medium under `state`'s
  1755	   new expander holds only the standard forms.  A require still pending
  1756	   on the old VM is dropped with it: its link pair is the session's, and
  1757	   the new session answers from its own.
  1758	
  1759	   Over a durable store the code index is not the session's to drop: the
  1760	   new indexer continues the old one's log, entity allocation, and
  1761	   published manifest (`yin.repl.index/carry-over`), so a rebuild never
  1762	   resets `t`.  Over the memory store it starts empty, as it always has."
